5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I worry about who will actually stand in the room when the season begins.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shion,,"We need to see where past deliveries failed, not just where they were planned.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,The record of what people actually enjoyed should be heard before we commit.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,The building itself must be able to hold whatever we promise to show.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I want to know where the money quietly disappears before the invoices arrive.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Shion, do you think the paperwork is the main bottleneck?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Shizue, I suspect the physical logistics are where we lose control.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,"@Sakura, have you seen the comment slips from previous years?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Shion, the floor load limits are a hard constraint we cannot ignore.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"@May, I think the visitor feedback is a great place to start looking.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I will look into the volunteer roster and the conservation lab staffing.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shion,,I will check the lender paperwork and the loan transport costs.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,May,,I will review the visitor comment slips and the weekend head counts.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I will examine the structural survey and the maintenance log for powered displays.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Sakura,,I will look at the mount-making charges and the evening hire bookings.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Shizue,,It is good to have clear paths forward for each of us.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Shion,,Let us see what the data says before we make promises.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,May,,I am curious to see if the numbers match my memory of the crowds.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I will ensure the physical space is safe for whatever we choose.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Sakura,,I hope the budget mystery solves itself with these reports.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
