35,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"The lab is down to one person, and the volunteers are mostly history guides.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shion,,Two openings slipped because paperwork arrived late. Transport costs ate a third of the budget.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,May,,"People come back because someone is there, not because of the objects.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Misaki,,The bay can only hold four hundred kilos per square metre. Powered displays caused four closures.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"Mounts cost double now, and evening hires damage open displays.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Misaki, if the bay is limited, we must avoid heavy or powered items.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Sakura, the transport costs are high, so we should favor local or lightweight loans.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,May,,"@Shizue, if we need people present, we need a show with live elements.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Shion, the maintenance log confirms that moving parts are a liability for us.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"@May, live elements might mean more staff, which Shizue is worried about.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""May"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Shizue,,We need a show that doesn't require heavy conservation or complex rigging.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shion,,We should avoid distant loans to save on transport and avoid paperwork delays.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,May,,A show with demonstrations or talks would satisfy the visitor desire for presence.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"I agree. We need something static or lightly interactive, not heavy or powered.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Sakura,,"So, no big stone works, no complex light rigs, and no distant heavy loans.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Shizue,,"This narrows it down significantly. We need local, light, and human-centric.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Shion,,Agreed. The data points to a specific type of exhibition.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,May,,I am ready to see the candidates with this in mind.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Misaki,,I will keep the structural limits in mind during the vote.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Sakura,,I hope the budget works out for the right choice.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
