71,3,3,talk,Shion,,I concur. It avoids the logistical pitfalls we identified.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,May,,I am voting for A. It brings the people back to the gallery.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Misaki,,I am voting for A. It respects the building's limits.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Sakura,,I am voting for A. It keeps the budget under control.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Shizue,,It feels like the right choice for our current situation.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Shion,,The data supports this decision clearly.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,May,,I am glad we listened to the visitors' voices.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Misaki,,"The building will be safe, and the staff will be manageable.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Sakura,,I hope the craftspeople enjoy their time with us.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
